      "id": 2,
      "claim": "Many popular hosta cultivars achieve their distinctive non‑green foliage (variegated white, gold, blue‑gray) through reduced chlorophyll in parts of the leaf.",
      "evidence": "Cultivar descriptions such as Hosta 'Patriot' (white margins), 'June' (gold leaves), and 'Halcyon' (blue‑gray) note that the non‑green areas lack or have lower chlorophyll content.",
      "weight": 0.30,
      "depends_on": [1]
    },
